What is an Outdoor Throw Pillow?
Outdoor throw pillows are engineered to provide both aesthetic appeal and functional durability for patios, decks, garden lounges, caravan interiors, and campsite seating areas. Core construction typically involves a high‑density polyester or acrylic fabric shell reinforced with UV‑stabilized dyes, sealed seams, and a fill material ranging from quick‑dry foam to compressible memory foam or lightweight inflatable chambers. The convergence of quick‑dry technology, recyclable fibers, and smart‑textile integrations has expanded the product beyond a niche accessory to a mainstream component of the outdoor‑comfort ecosystem.
